            <li><strong>Contact Us:</strong> Submit a message through our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">Contact Form</a>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Approved historical refunds are credited back to the original payment method within 3 to 5 business days.</p>

        <h2>3. Zero Recurring Charges</h2>
        <p>You can use all PDF parsing, TF-IDF evaluation, and Recharts features without limitation or recurring billing.</p>

        <h2>6. Questions?</h2>
